BonBridge - third party components
==================================

BonBridge bundles ("vendors") the components below so that installing it never
depends on a third-party repository staying online. Their licences apply to the
bundled copies; BonBridge's own code is MIT (see LICENSE).

Each vendored directory contains a VENDORED_COMMIT file recording the exact
upstream revision the copy was taken from.


1. zj-58  ->  vendor/zj-58/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   CUPS raster filter for ESC/POS thermal printers (ZJ-58 / ZJ-80 and
   compatible), used by the optional CUPS module.

   Upstream: https://github.com/klirichek/zj-58
   Copyright (c) 2014 Aleksey N. Vinogradov
   Licence: BSD 2-Clause "Simplified" License  (see vendor/zj-58/LICENSE)


2. escpos-printer-db  ->  vendor/escpos-printer-db/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Community maintained capability database for ESC/POS receipt printers
   (fonts, columns, code pages, cutter/barcode/QR support). BonBridge uses
   the compiled dist/capabilities.json to identify attached printers and to
   derive the recommended POS settings.

   Upstream: https://github.com/receipt-print-hq/escpos-printer-db
   Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
            (see vendor/escpos-printer-db/LICENSE.md)
   Attribution: escpos-printer-db contributors,
                https://github.com/receipt-print-hq/escpos-printer-db


